  "solution": "BODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7469776d8b5353b3e336b6395ae8257280794a1d7a06ead22e8b607d2875fb7b.png] \n\nGiven equation: 42 + 16 ÷ 7 - 36 × 16 = 76\n\nLet's check each option by interchanging the signs,\n\n1) + and -\n\n→ 42 - __**16 ÷ 7**__ + 36 × 16 = 76\n\n→ 42 - 2.29 + __**36 × 16**__ = 76\n\n→ __**42**__ - 2.29 __**+ 576**__ = 76\n\n→ __**618**____** - 2.29**__ = 76\n\n→ 615.71 ≠ 76\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n2) ÷ and ×\n\n→ 42 + 16 × 7 - __**36 ÷ 16**__ = 76\n\n→ 42 + __**16 × 7**__ - 2.25 = 76\n\n→ __**42 + 112**__ - 2.25 = 76\n\n→ __**154 - 2.25**__ = 76\n\n→ 151.75 ≠ 76\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n3) **× and +**\n\n→ __**42 × 16 ÷ 7**__ - 36 + 16 = 76\n\n→ __**96**__ - 36 __**+ 16**__ = 76\n\n→ **__112 – 36__** = 76\n\n→ **76 = 76**\n\n→ LHS = RHS.\n\n4) ÷ and +\n\n→ __**42 ÷ 16**__ + 7 - 36 × 16 = 76\n\n→ 2.625 + 7 - __**36 × 16**__ = 76\n\n→ __**2.625 + 7**__ - 576 = 76\n\n→ __**9.625 - 576**__ = 76\n\n→ -566.375 ≠ 76\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\nHere, we can see that only 'Option 3' satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 3**\".",
